  "result_event": 591,
  "channel": "D05SD5QLG94",
  "thread_ts": null,
  "text": "Done. The brief and hand-off list are in my Drive, shared view-only with you, Brian, Robert and PlayableX intake.\n• Brief: https://docs.google.com/document/d/8505dd1432aa4998b4b74087/edit\n• Hand-off list: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1g2aY3O7AfSz4XXKvmAy2dXdG35_Ll5C8uT0iQoSkxds/edit\n\nCounts across the 96 lines:\n• *Delivered: 8*\n• *Ready: 68*\n• *Owed: 20*. Claire 9, Brian 7, Calvin 3, Martin 1.\n\nThings that changed from Brian's notes:\n• Robert put the Bow in the 8 in place of Dynamite on 26 Sep. The board is now Grenade, Couch, Plushie Chick, Shuriken, Cute Axe, Gift Box, Cactus Plant, Bow.\n• Cactus, Chainsaw and Cone got new colour versions on 29 Sep, after Claire's export, so they need to go again. The Cactus is on the board.\n• Rocket and Explosion sounds are from a library and a bought pack, so they stay here until Calvin makes our own.\n• Zombies: Party Girl, Plumber, Magician, Football Player, walk animation only.\n\nThe 20 Owed tickets are in Todo with a comment saying what's owed and who has it."
 },
 {
  "event": 592,
  "id": "toolu_vrtx_01R96y7RsHqReX7zsMKcDcPo",
  "tool": "slack_send_message",
  "context": "main",
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 593,
  "channel": "C08H78VJG80",
  "thread_ts": null,
  "text": "Hi PlayableX team! Ahead of the 3 November start, here's the brief to build from and our hand-off list:\n• Brief: https://docs.google.com/document/d/8505dd1432aa4998b4b74087/edit\n• Hand-off list: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1g2aY3O7AfSz4XXKvmAy2dXdG35_Ll5C8uT0iQoSkxds/edit\n\nBoth are shared view-only with intake@playablex.ai.\n\nThe hand-off list has one row per asset, marked Delivered, Ready (exported and waiting to go out to you) or Owed. Owed rows say what's still coming from us. As of today, 20 items are still owed. These include a re-export of the Cactus Plant (one of the 8 board items), our own rocket and explosion sounds, the background music loop, fonts, item icons and UI PNGs.\n\nTo answer your zombie question: please use one animation, walk, on Party Girl, Plumber, Magician and Football Player. All four are in the Unity package from 26 Sep.\n\nThe brief reflects the game as it is today. If the core changes, we'll go through the affected parts with you in November."
 }
]
